title: 주1_월_1교시_도서관_신아산_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
(I see ASan stuck in the library, buried in books since the very first week of the semester.)
(Applied Blockchain...)
(It looks like she's already prepping for the class in the next period.)
{name()}: Whatcha doin'?
ASan: .......
{name()}: Hello? Anyone home?
<<show san_shock>>
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: Whoa! You scared the daylight out of me!!!!
{name()}: It's only the first week. You're studying already?
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Duh, obviously.
ASan: Learning is short, but life is long.
ASan: And learning is just a continuation of life.
{name()}: Wait, that sounds a bit... off.
<<choice 주1_월_1교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Isn't it 'Life is short, art is long'?" 주1_월_1교시_도서관_신아산_부정1_영문 "True, you've got a point.">>
(Should I correct her or not?)
===

title: 주1_월_1교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Isn't it "Life is short, and learning is long"?
{name()}: And I think it's supposed to be "Life is a continuous process of learning."
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Wh-what????
ASan: I knew that!
ASan: It was just a slip of the tongue.
ASan: You totally think I'm an idiot right now, don't you?! I knew it!
{name()}: No, not really.
{name()}: I just...
{name()}: I think the way you react to your own mistakes is kind of cute.
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 10>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: C-cu...
ASan: C-c-c-c-cute?
ASan: .....
ASan: Fine.
ASan: I, I get it. Th-thanks.
ASan: ............
ASan: I-I have to g-go to class now!
ASan: It was n-nice seeing you!
(Before I could even say a word, ASan packs her things at lightning speed.)
(She bolted for the classroom a whole hour before the lecture starts.)
<<end>>
===

